The bug was caused by the use of a temporary directory located in `/tmp`, which can lead to issues with test isolation and cleanup, especially in environments where multiple tests may run concurrently. This patch changes the directory to a more controlled location under the `target` directory, ensuring that each test has its own unique directory based on the test method name, thus preventing conflicts and ensuring proper cleanup after tests.
